  "notes": "{貢献|こうけん} means contribution - helping to achieve something or improve a situation. Functions as both noun and suru-verb.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {貢献|こうけん}する\n\nKEY PATTERN:\n〜に{貢献|こうけん}する: to contribute to ~\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {社会|しゃかい}に{貢献|こうけん}する: to contribute to society\n- {大|おお}きな{貢献|こうけん}: great contribution\n- {貢献|こうけん}{度|ど}: degree/level of contribution\n- {社会|しゃかい}{貢献|こうけん}{活動|かつどう}: social contribution activities\n\nCONTEXTS:\n- Business: {会社|かいしゃ}の{発展|はってん}に{貢献|こうけん}する (contribute to company growth)\n- Research: {科学|かがく}の{発展|はってん}に{貢献|こうけん}する (contribute to scientific progress)\n- Sports: チームの{勝利|しょうり}に{貢献|こうけん}する (contribute to team victory)\n\nREGISTER:\nSlightly formal; common in business, academic, and official contexts.",
